<p>				     SUMMARY OF OPERATIONS</p>
<p>					   (Unaudited)</p>
<p>(Amounts in thousands, except per-share data)</p>
<p>	 Three months ended May 31, 1997 and 1996</p>
<p>							1997	 1996</p>
<p>						  Operating profit (loss)</p>
<p>							1997	 1996</p>
<p>    Net income				 $ 29,434   $ 27,677</p>
